{
 "Name": "Suricata - Suspicious HTTP User Agents",
 "Description": "HTTP requests whose User-Agent matches a scripting/tooling signature (curl, wget, python-requests, PowerShell, sqlmap, Nikto, nmap, masscan), matched case-insensitively. Expected from automation in most networks; investigate unexpected sources. Substring matches, so curl also matches libcurl-based agents.",
